STATUS: Research preview — a work in progress, not a finished product.

jojo is an ongoing research and development project, published so the approach
can be examined and tested. It is not a finished product, it is not supported,
and it should not be relied on for anything that matters without your own
backups and your own judgement.

Features exist to be tried and measured rather than because they are settled.
Behaviour, storage formats and screens can change between versions, and a change
may lose records written by an earlier one.

The Apache-2.0 licence above lets you use, change and redistribute this, and
that grant stands. What we ask is that you do not pass it on as a finished or
supported product, and that anything built on it carries this notice — the
person downstream deserves to know it is research code as much as you did.

