This product bundles no third-party source code.

The programs jojo TALKS TO — MarkItDown, and whichever model server you point
it at — are installed and run by you on your own machine; none of their code is
vendored into this repository or into either app bundle. Their notices are
reproduced in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md anyway, because a person running them
deserves to see the terms without going to look.

Runtime dependencies are fetched from npm and carry their own licences, which
travel with them in node_modules. The Guide's "Built with" page lists them by
name, with each one's licence and copyright holder.
